  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Gluten Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Peptide</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Fragrance Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean at Sephora</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>A lightweight, quick-absorbing gel serum that hydrates and brightens the look of skin while visibly plumping over time.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Skin Type:</strong> Normal, Dry, Combination, and Oily</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Skincare Concerns:</strong> Dullness, Dryness, and Uneven Texture</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Formulation:</strong> Serum</p><p><br></p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><p><strong>Suggested Usage:<br></strong></p><p >- Morning and night after cleansing, glaze face, neck, and décolleté with one to two pumps.&nbsp;</p><p>- Follow with Barrier Restore Cream or Barrier Butter for best results (each sold separately).&nbsp;</p></div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\"><p >- Peptide: Short chain of amino acids that revitalizes skin and improves radiance.</p><p>- Niacinamide: A form of vitamin B3 that brightens and improves skin’s overall texture.</p><p>- Marula Oil: A lightweight natural oil rich in fatty acids that helps soothe &amp; hydrate.</p><p><br></p><p>water (aqua) (eau), glycerin, butylene glycol, sclerocarya birrea seed oil, niacinamide, tetradecane, capryloyl glycerin/sebacic acid copolymer, diheptyl succinate, acetyl hexapeptide-8, sodium hyaluronate, hydroxyacetophenone, caprylyl glycol, glyceryl oleate, dilauryl thiodipropionate, acrylates/c10-30 alkyl acrylate crosspolymer, carbomer, sucrose palmitate, sodium phosphate, disodium phosphate, phenoxyethanol, sodium hydroxide, benzyl alcohol.</p><p><br></p><p>The list of ingredients is subject to change. Please consult the packaging of the product purchased.</p></div></details>",
